  "details": "The pre-build validation for \"Load in Background\" on audio clips does not seem to be aware of the new \"VRC Animator Play Audio\" state behavior.\n\nNo autofix is provided, SDK lets you attempt to upload, upload will fail in post-build validation.\n\nRepro:\n\n- Use the \"VRC Animator Play Audio\" component with audio clips that have \"Load in Background\" disabled.\n\nAvatar SDK 3.6.0, Unity 2022.3.22f1",
